 "summary": "Relates to defense and indemnification obligations relating to the Route 9A bikeway/Greenway adjacent to the Hudson river park.",
 "title": "Relates to defense and indemnification obligations relating to the Route 9A bikeway/Greenway adjacent to the Hudson river park",
